<title>USA: Prophet 21 says intends to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Prophet 21 says intends to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>YARDLEY, Pa. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prophet 21 Inc said on Wednesday it intends to repurchase up to an additional 200,000 shares of its common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>Prophet 21 has already completed the purchase of 400,000 shares of its common stock, now held as treasury shares, the company said.</p>
<p>Prophet 21 provides on-line business management systems for use by distributors, wholesalers and dealers.</p>
</text>
